    "updated_at": "2017-03-09T21:24:41Z",
    "body": "For the case of `new CustomEvent(\"beforeunload\", { cancelable: true })` with a handler that returns `false`, it appears everyone except Gecko cancels the event. We should probably update the spec to key off the event handler type then... I'll update the spec.",
